            },
            {
              "text": "He said that the rich marquis was falling into water.",
              "audioStart": 98.525,
              "audioEnd": 101.1
            },
            {
              "text": "The king immediately sent guards to save the young man.",
              "audioStart": 101.963,
              "audioEnd": 104.675
            },
            {
              "text": "The king provided him with wonderful clothes.",
              "audioStart": 105.537,
              "audioEnd": 107.925
            },
            {
              "text": "The king looked at the young man and smiled warmly.",
              "audioStart": 108.787,
              "audioEnd": 111.263
            },
            {
              "text": "The royal guards pulled the master out of the river very quickly.",
              "audioStart": 112.125,
              "audioEnd": 115.287
            },
            {
              "text": "The young man wore the fine new clothes that the king provided.",
              "audioStart": 116.15,
              "audioEnd": 119.175
            },
            {
              "text": "He looked like a true man standing by the water.",
              "audioStart": 120.037,
              "audioEnd": 122.463
            },
            {
              "text": "The king invited him to ride in the royal car for the rest of the journey.",
              "audioStart": 123.325,
              "audioEnd": 126.9
            },
            {
              "text": "The master felt very happy about this turn of events.",
              "audioStart": 127.763,
              "audioEnd": 130.488
            },
            {
              "text": "He sat beside the king and talked about many different subjects.",
              "audioStart": 131.35,
              "audioEnd": 134.75
            },
            {
              "text": "The young woman looked at him and smiled several times.",
              "audioStart": 135.613,
              "audioEnd": 138.35
            },
            {
              "text": "She thought that he was a very charming person.",
              "audioStart": 139.213,
              "audioEnd": 141.5
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "While the king drove along the road, the cat ran ahead to manage a smart plan.",
              "audioStart": 142.363,
              "audioEnd": 146.262
            },
            {
              "text": "He commanded local workers in the fields to tell the king that the land belonged to the marquis.",
              "audioStart": 147.125,
              "audioEnd": 151.775
            },
            {
              "text": "The ruler felt very impressed because the supposed person owned such large properties.",
              "audioStart": 152.637,
              "audioEnd": 157.188
            },
            {
              "text": "Meanwhile, the cat entered a great castle that belonged to a powerful, rich giant.",
              "audioStart": 158.05,
              "audioEnd": 162.625
            },
            {
              "text": "The dangerous owner could change his shape into any animal that he wanted.",
              "audioStart": 163.488,
              "audioEnd": 166.95
            },
            {
              "text": "The smart cat pretended to feel doubt.",
              "audioStart": 167.812,
              "audioEnd": 169.85
            },
            {
              "text": "He asked if the giant could become a tiny mouse.",
              "audioStart": 170.713,
              "audioEnd": 173.213
            },
            {
              "text": "As soon as the silly giant turned into a small mouse, the quick cat jumped on him.",
              "audioStart": 174.075,
              "audioEnd": 178.387
            },
            {
              "text": "He caught the little creature immediately.",
              "audioStart": 179.25,
              "audioEnd": 181.175
            },
            {
              "text": "He won the great castle for his master.",
              "audioStart": 182.037,
              "audioEnd": 184.175
            },
            {
              "text": "The giant had lived in that building for many years.",
              "audioStart": 185.037,
              "audioEnd": 187.637
            },
            {
              "text": "He controlled all the surrounding fields and forests.",
              "audioStart": 188.5,
              "audioEnd": 191.3
            },
            {
              "text": "When he changed into the tiny mouse, he made a big mistake.",
              "audioStart": 192.162,
              "audioEnd": 195.4
            },
            {
              "text": "The cat had waited for this exact moment.",
              "audioStart": 196.262,
              "audioEnd": 198.55
            },
            {
              "text": "He moved faster than the mouse could run.",
              "audioStart": 199.412,
              "audioEnd": 201.4
            },
            {
              "text": "The giant was gone forever.",
              "audioStart": 202.262,
              "audioEnd": 203.787
            },
            {
              "text": "The castle was now free for a new owner.",
              "audioStart": 204.65,
              "audioEnd": 206.675
            },
            {
              "text": "The cat waited inside the great hall for the royal car to arrive.",
              "audioStart": 207.537,
              "audioEnd": 211.012
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "sentences": [
            {
              "text": "When the king arrived at the great castle, the happy cat welcomed the royal guests outside.",
              "audioStart": 211.875,
              "audioEnd": 216.6
            },
            {
              "text": "Delighted by the charming marquis and his vast lands, the king offered his daughter in marriage.",
              "audioStart": 217.463,
              "audioEnd": 222.375
            },
            {
              "text": "The young man married the princess and became a rich person.",
              "audioStart": 223.238,
              "audioEnd": 226.325
            },
            {
              "text": "As for the smart animal, he lived happily.",
              "audioStart": 227.188,
              "audioEnd": 229.537
            },
            {
              "text": "He never needed to chase mice again except for his own fun.",
              "audioStart": 230.4,
              "audioEnd": 233.5
            },
            {
              "text": "The wedding celebration lasted for many days.",
              "audioStart": 234.363,
              "audioEnd": 236.925
            },
            {
              "text": "People came from all over the country to see the happy couple.",
              "audioStart": 237.787,
              "audioEnd": 240.65
            },
            {
              "text": "The king gave them many gifts and wished them a long life together.",
              "audioStart": 241.512,
              "audioEnd": 244.912
            },
            {
              "text": "The former poor man now ruled the region as a true man.",
              "audioStart": 245.775,
              "audioEnd": 248.613
            },
            {
              "text": "He never forgot how much he owed to his faithful cat.",
              "audioStart": 249.475,
              "audioEnd": 252.2
            },
            {
              "text": "The cat spent his days resting by the warm fire in the great hall.",
              "audioStart": 253.062,
              "audioEnd": 256.575
            },
            {
              "text": "He caught a mouse sometimes just for fun.",
              "audioStart": 257.438,
              "audioEnd": 259.525
            },
            {
              "text": "He never had to worry about food again.",
              "audioStart": 260.387,
              "audioEnd": 262.363
            },
            {
              "text": "Everyone in the country remembered the story of the smart cat and the Marquis of Carabas.",
              "audioStart": 263.225,
              "audioEnd": 268.612
            },
            {
              "text": "It became one of the most famous tales in the whole world.",
              "audioStart": 269.474,
              "audioEnd": 272.262
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
